Z||000001||GTFiero1||11-25-2001||07:58 PM||||Impala SS all the way! we use to have on until an unfortunate accident. there are tons fo stuff for it.. we had a 1994 which only 6,303 were built, the 96's are the best with the consol shifter. <A HREF="http://www.impalaclub.com" TARGET=_blank>www.impalaclub.com</A>   if you buy one you'll love it. they are nice and BIG and people with think you are an un-marked cop car some times (a guy pulled over when we were behind him once) and they have all the power to keep up or out run almost anything. 260hp rear wheel drive, 17in tires, leather and room for 5. one hell of a car<P>------------------<BR>Adam J. B.<P>you gotta keep on keepin on...||||reg||1
